{"id":"722406899ea4f1e2","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-higher-order-signature.md","title":"df-higher-order-signature","display":"df-higher-order-signature","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"1","label":"16-df-higher-order-signature","aliases":["16-df-higher-order-signature","Higher-order signature"],"display":"df-higher-order-signature","depends_on":[],"source":"§5.1 pp.313–315 (PDF333–335); atomic-arity signature in curried finite-tree encoding","revision_date":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-higher-order-signature"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-higher-order-signature</span><span>Higher-order signature</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-higher-order-signature"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source","html":"§5.1 pp.313–315 (PDF333–335); atomic-arity signature in curried finite-tree encoding"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B,C\">\\(B,C\\)</span> 为小集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf b,\\mathsf p,\\mathsf1,\\mathsf x,\\mathsf r\">\\(\\mathsf b,\\mathsf p,\\mathsf1,\\mathsf x,\\mathsf r\\)</span> 为互不混淆的单射有限树标签，分别编码基本类型、Prop、单位类型、积类型、函数类型。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ty}\">\\(\\operatorname{ty}\\)</span> 是候选型属函数图，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(B,C,\\operatorname{ty})\">\\(\\Sigma=(B,C,\\operatorname{ty})\\)</span>。原始操作只接受并返回原子类型（含 Prop）；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Cur}\">\\(\\operatorname{Cur}\\)</span> 把这种有限多参数型属编码成一个柯里化类型。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec D\">\\(\\vec D\\)</span> 遍历所示类型集合的有限列表。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HOSig}\">\\(\\mathrm{HOSig}\\)</span> 为下文定义的签名谓词。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Atom}_B&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\mathsf b(b)\\mid b\\in B\\}\\cup\\{\\mathsf p\\},\\\\\nT^0_B&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\mathsf b(b)\\mid b\\in B\\}\\cup\\{\\mathsf p,\\mathsf1\\},\\\\\nT^{k+1}_B&amp;\\coloneqq T^k_B\\cup\\{\\mathsf x(A,D),\\mathsf r(A,D)\\mid A,D\\in T^k_B\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Type}_\\Sigma&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}T^k_B,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Prop}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf p,\\quad1\\coloneqq\\mathsf1,\\quad\nA\\times D\\coloneqq\\mathsf x(A,D),\\quad A\\Rightarrow D\\coloneqq\\mathsf r(A,D),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Cur}((),A)&amp;\\coloneqq A,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Cur}((D,\\vec E),A)&amp;\\coloneqq D\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Cur}(\\vec E,A),\\\\\n\\operatorname{PrimType}_B&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{Cur}(\\vec D,A)\\mid\\vec D\\in\\operatorname{Atom}_B^{&lt;\\omega}\\land A\\in\\operatorname{Atom}_B\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{HOSig}(\\Sigma)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{ty}:C\\to\\operatorname{PrimType}_B,\\\\\n\\operatorname{PredType}()&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Prop},\\\\\n\\operatorname{PredType}(A,\\vec D)&amp;\\coloneqq A\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{PredType}(\\vec D).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Atom}_B&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\mathsf b(b)\\mid b\\in B\\}\\cup\\{\\mathsf p\\},\\\\\nT^0_B&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\mathsf b(b)\\mid b\\in B\\}\\cup\\{\\mathsf p,\\mathsf1\\},\\\\\nT^{k+1}_B&amp;\\coloneqq T^k_B\\cup\\{\\mathsf x(A,D),\\mathsf r(A,D)\\mid A,D\\in T^k_B\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Type}_\\Sigma&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}T^k_B,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Prop}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf p,\\quad1\\coloneqq\\mathsf1,\\quad\nA\\times D\\coloneqq\\mathsf x(A,D),\\quad A\\Rightarrow D\\coloneqq\\mathsf r(A,D),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Cur}((),A)&amp;\\coloneqq A,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Cur}((D,\\vec E),A)&amp;\\coloneqq D\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Cur}(\\vec E,A),\\\\\n\\operatorname{PrimType}_B&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{Cur}(\\vec D,A)\\mid\\vec D\\in\\operatorname{Atom}_B^{&lt;\\omega}\\land A\\in\\operatorname{Atom}_B\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{HOSig}(\\Sigma)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{ty}:C\\to\\operatorname{PrimType}_B,\\\\\n\\operatorname{PredType}()&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Prop},\\\\\n\\operatorname{PredType}(A,\\vec D)&amp;\\coloneqq A\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{PredType}(\\vec D).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>§5.1 pp.313–315 (PDF333–335) 把高阶签名定义为含指定原子类型 Prop 的多型签名，原始函数符号的输入与输出均为原子类型；其上的高阶逻辑才进一步生成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1,\\times,\\Rightarrow\">\\(1,\\times,\\Rightarrow\\)</span> 类型。本页保留 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(B,C,\\operatorname{ty})\">\\((B,C,\\operatorname{ty})\\)</span> 接口，以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Cur}\">\\(\\operatorname{Cur}\\)</span> 编码原书的多参数型属。自由类型树唯一分解，故每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PrimType}_B\">\\(\\operatorname{PrimType}_B\\)</span> 唯一还原为原子输入列表与原子输出（零元符号直接为原子型常量）。</p>\n<p>此前允许原始常元具有任意派生类型，范围宽于原书，不能仅凭柯里化宣称与 Definition 5.1.1 完全相同。现在仅限制原始型属，仍为后续逻辑生成全部有限积与函数类型；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PredType}\">\\(\\operatorname{PredType}\\)</span> 可对派生型参数形成谓词类型，但并不把每个这种类型都自动指定为原始符号型属。有限树递归保证类型和柯里化构造存在且唯一；本页只定义签名，不声称完整 HOL 推导与解释。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"B,C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf b,\\mathsf p,\\mathsf1,\\mathsf x,\\mathsf r","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ty}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma=(B,C,\\operatorname{ty})","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Cur}","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec D","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HOSig}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Atom}_B&\\coloneqq\\{\\mathsf b(b)\\mid b\\in B\\}\\cup\\{\\mathsf p\\},\\\\\nT^0_B&\\coloneqq\\{\\mathsf b(b)\\mid b\\in B\\}\\cup\\{\\mathsf p,\\mathsf1\\},\\\\\nT^{k+1}_B&\\coloneqq T^k_B\\cup\\{\\mathsf x(A,D),\\mathsf r(A,D)\\mid A,D\\in T^k_B\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Type}_\\Sigma&\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}T^k_B,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Prop}&\\coloneqq\\mathsf p,\\quad1\\coloneqq\\mathsf1,\\quad\nA\\times D\\coloneqq\\mathsf x(A,D),\\quad A\\Rightarrow D\\coloneqq\\mathsf r(A,D),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Cur}((),A)&\\coloneqq A,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Cur}((D,\\vec E),A)&\\coloneqq D\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Cur}(\\vec E,A),\\\\\n\\operatorname{PrimType}_B&\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{Cur}(\\vec D,A)\\mid\\vec D\\in\\operatorname{Atom}_B^{<\\omega}\\land A\\in\\operatorname{Atom}_B\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{HOSig}(\\Sigma)&\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{ty}:C\\to\\operatorname{PrimType}_B,\\\\\n\\operatorname{PredType}()&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Prop},\\\\\n\\operatorname{PredType}(A,\\vec D)&\\coloneqq A\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{PredType}(\\vec D).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"1,\\times,\\Rightarrow","display":false},{"tex":"(B,C,\\operatorname{ty})","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Cur}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PrimType}_B","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PredType}","display":false}],"bytes":2969,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-259","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-df-higher-order-signature|df-higher-order-signature]]"}],"outgoing":[]}